    "summary": "Use it in your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) on 1 **PROSECUTORS** unit of yours that has just shot. Pick an enemy unit that at least 1 of those attacks hit: until your next turn starts, it is prosecuted as long as your unit remains on the battlefield. Effects on a prosecuted unit:\n\n- Attacks by **ANATHEMA PSYKANA** models against it improve their Armour Penetration by 1.\n- If it is a **PSYKER** or **Battle-shocked** unit, attacks by its models get −1 to the **Hit roll**.",
